                                                "sense_id": "50902e80-0d9c-3181-b217-0f642a57566b",
                                                "text": "As I tentatively reverse, I have a sense of foreboding, unsure I’ll be able to control this overgrown mechanical beast. I am posing to the salesman as someone who is seeking maximum protection on the city roads, yet I suspect that I look very much like a man who usually drives a tiny hatchback."
                                            }
